WEBVTT

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:04.425
A deputy’s name is not enough Aisha is appointed as

00:00:04.425 --> 00:00:09.475
deputy Before the later update that fact does not establish

00:00:09.475 --> 00:00:14.095
acceptance of this evening assignment Identify the evidence that would

00:00:14.095 --> 00:00:19.615
make transfer usable and distinguish administrative cover from responsibilities retained

00:00:19.615 --> 00:00:23.365
by the control room Naming a person or sending an

00:00:23.365 --> 00:00:27.995
attachment does not complete a handover Write the evidence needed

00:00:27.995 --> 00:00:32.210
for transfer and what stays with the independent control room
